<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Sets the AppearanceType of a creature. Can be used in <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Character%20generation" title="Character generation">character generation</a> and <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Shapeshifting" title="Shapeshifting (page does not exist)">shapeshifting</a>.
</p>
